    content: "# ===== Telegram bot (Python, app.py) =====\n\n# Telegram Bot token from @BotFather (required)\nBOT_TOKEN=\"1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz\"\n\n# PostgreSQL / Supabase with asyncpg\nDATABASE_URL=\"postgresql+asyncpg://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/ecommerce_bot\"\n\n# Telegram Native Payment Tokens (@BotFather -> Payments -> Click / Payme)\nCLICK_PROVIDER_TOKEN=\"398061629:TEST:999999\"\nPAYME_PROVIDER_TOKEN=\"371317599:TEST:999999\"\n\n# Google AI Studio API key (https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)\n# Also used by the AI Studio web preview below.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\nGEMINI_MODEL=\"gemini-2.5-flash\"\nGEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL=\"gemini-2.5-flash-image\"\nIMAGE_GEN_CONCURRENCY=2\n\n# Pricing (UZS): one purchase = 1 package = CARDS_PER_PACKAGE cards\nPACKAGE_PRICE_UZS=15000\nCARDS_PER_PACKAGE=5\nFREE_TRIAL_CREDITS=1\n\n# ===== AI Studio web preview (server.ts / src) =====\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n",
